# Copy to `.env` (untracked) and point these at YOUR install. The justfile reads them via
# `set dotenv-load` + env_var_or_default, so every recipe follows them — the CMake-driven
# ones (configure, build, deploy) AND the ones that touch the game directly (install, run,
# log, status, go), which is the half a stale CMake cache cannot cover. Without a `.env` the
# tree falls back to the default Steam library under C:\Program Files (x86).
#
# GAME_PATH is the WOTC subfolder, not the XCOM 2 root: `Binaries/Win64` and `XComGame/Mods`
# hang off it. Forward slashes; quote the values, these paths contain spaces.
XCOM2_GAME_PATH="C:/Program Files (x86)/Steam/steamapps/common/XCOM 2/XCom2-WarOfTheChosen"
XCOM2_SDK_PATH="C:/Program Files (x86)/Steam/steamapps/common/XCOM 2 War of the Chosen SDK"
